# 📌 1. DEFINITIONS

1.1 “System”  
Refers to all source code, modules, scripts, documentation, and architecture under VanzyBot project.

1.2 “Developer”  
Refers to original creator or maintainer of VanzyBot system identity.

1.3 “User”  
Any individual, group, or organization that accesses, runs, modifies, or distributes the system.

1.4 “Modification”  
Any change including but not limited to:
- code editing  
- structure changes  
- feature injection  
- module replacement  

1.5 “Distribution”  
Sharing, uploading, selling, or publishing system in any form.

